WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.825
The two strips join into one, and the corner is the two numbers multiplied.

2
00:00:05.826 --> 00:00:08.251
The strips are five x and two x.

3
00:00:09.127 --> 00:00:12.152
Together that's seven x. Five plus two.

4
00:00:12.803 --> 00:00:15.553
The corner is ten. Five times two.
